    <tags>lithuania lithuanian baby-names names statistics cli</tags>
    <summary>Most popular newborn names in Lithuania (2024, Registry Centre open data) on the command line.</summary>
    <description>Command line tool with the most popular newborn names in Lithuania (2024, VĮ Registrų centras open data).

- `naujagimiu-vardai` – top 10 girls' and boys' names
- `naujagimiu-vardai --top 20 --lytis berniukai` – top 20 boys' names
- `naujagimiu-vardai --vardas lukne` – the rank of a name (diacritics optional)

Baptism names with meanings and name days: https://krikstynudovana.lt/kriksto-vardai/

Code MIT, data CC BY 4.0.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/ello-lithuania/lietuviski-vardadieniai/releases</releaseNotes>
